WEBVTT

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.200
<i>Professor Celia,</i>

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.210
<i>It's been three days since I left Beltrant,
 the royal capital.</i>

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.210
<b>Year 996 of the Holy Era, Summer</b>

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.330
<i>I've safely reached a neighboring kingdom,</i>

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.710
<i>and arrived in Amande, a market 
town in the Kingdom of Galarc.</i>

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:33.240
<b>Kingdom of Galarc, Amande Market Town</b>

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.760
Not here... right?

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.390
<i>As there were wanted posters 
circulating in the royal capital,</i>

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:46.350
<i>it was difficult to procure the 
items I needed for my journey,</i>

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.940
<i>but they haven't reached this town yet,</i>

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.380
<i>so please don't worry about me.</i>

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.320
<i>Amande is a bustling, lively town.</i>

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.280
<i>Foodstuffs are plentiful,</i>

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.490
<i>and it looks like I'll be able to acquire 
preserved foods quickly, which is a relief.</i>

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.770
<i>I guess I'm a little too on edge.</i>

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.150
Seirei Gensouki

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.150
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:48.730
<b>The Assassin Girl</b>

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:48.730
<b>The Assassin Girl</b>

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.140
Welcome!

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:50.490
We have soup-style pasta!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:53.230
One bowl for eight lesser coppers!

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.070
Did you say... pasta?

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:59.180
Huh? Son, is this your 
first time in this town?

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.570
Uh, yes.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.260
Soup-style pasta! Lady Liselotte, 
the one who governs Amande,

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.820
invented something out of wheat called 
"noodles," and this dish uses those.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.200
Liselotte...

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.380
This is the finished dish.

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:15.290
Thanks for waiting!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:16.970
<i>Pasta...</i>

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:19.480
<i>It's the first time I've 
seen it in this world.</i>

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.430
<i>And I heard the word "noodles," too.</i>

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.000
Looks good, right?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.750
And it really is good, too!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.320
Then, can I have one bowl, please?

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.450
Thanks for the business!

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:37.910
It's delicious!

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:39.270
Right?

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:41.820
<i>It's a nostalgic flavor.</i>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:48.340
<i>Could it be that this Liselotte person 
also came from the same world as Haruto?</i>

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.390
<i>Not that it matters at this point.</i>

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.490
<i>Thinking about that stuff doesn't mean 
there's anything that can be done about it.</i>

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:03.400
When you're bigger, I'll take you there.
 It's a place called Yagumo.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:05.770
Really? You promised, okay?

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.510
<i>I...</i>

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:11.140
<i>I want to see the place my 
mother and father came from.</i>

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.640
<i>It was a promise I made with my mother.</i>

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.260
Is that it?

00:04:19.700 --> 00:04:21.740
You want to buy noodles?

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.990
Yes. I think they'll be good 
to take on my journey.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.300
Oh, and this was delicious.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:30.490
In that case, try heading down that 
way to the Ricca merchant guild.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.180
There should be a long line to the 
menjuu shop on the first floor,

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.690
so I'm sure you'll recognize it right away.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.500
Did you say... menjuu?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:41.330
Yeah! It's another thing 
that Lady Liselotte...

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.700
It's yummy, isn't it?

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:43.750
Yeah!

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:47.470
Two meat menjuu and one cheese menjuu!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.850
Thank you for waiting!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.350
They're hot, so please be careful.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.100
<i>Manjuu meat buns?</i>

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.310
<i>That feels nostalgic, somehow.</i>

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.560
Hello. Welcome to the Ricca merchant guild.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.270
Thank you very much.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.930
We hope you'll come again soon.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.470
Sir?

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:10.370
We ask that you refrain from 
wearing a sword within the store.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.450
You can check your things, and we can 
look after them for you if you'd like.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.230
Oh, thank you.

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.410
<i>Black hair?</i>

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.880
If you would, please.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.380
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:28.770
I will be helping you today.
 My name is Lotte.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.820
Come in.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.240
Excuse me.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.610
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.940
Fifteen kilos of dried pasta 
and ten kilos of barley.

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:55.750
I've also readied cooking 
implements and seasonings.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.660
Have you? Thank you very much.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:04.110
I added a large rucksack, 
but it's all very heavy.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.170
Will you be all right carrying it home?

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:08.140
Please, have some.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:09.340
Thank you.

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:13.500
I may not look it, but I've done a lot of 
physical training. Please, don't worry.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.940
Are you accustomed to drinking black tea?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.500
Among my acquaintances is 
a lady who loves black tea.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.240
As I drank it with her, I learned a lot.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:33.990
In that case, could it be that you 
recognize what those tea leaves are?

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.950
This unique aroma and slight astringency...

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:44.010
Are these leaves from Lis? 
You use very good tea here.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.750
And this teaware, too.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:49.080
In order to have the best possible 
dealings with our customers,

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.760
the environment for the negotiations 
must be as perfect as possible.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.830
That's our merchant guild's motto!

00:06:55.210 --> 00:07:00.770
Then... may we undertake the 
delivery of a letter for you?

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:02.770
Yes.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:07.540
<i>And so, I've successfully completed 
my purchases, and I'm about to set out.</i>

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:11.330
<i>Once I leave the Strahl region, 
I won't be able to send more letters,</i>

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.960
<i>but please don't worry.</i>

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.950
<i>No news of me is proof that I am doing well.</i>

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.980
<i>I'm off.</i>

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.140
<i>Haruto.</i>

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:21.930
Take care.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.820
Thank you for all your help.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:32.220
That boy was a bit mysterious, 
wasn't he, Lady Liselotte?

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.610
I'm Lotte right now, Cosette.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.470
So you are.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:46.110
<i>A child?</i>

00:07:46.750 --> 00:07:48.360
Hey, are you all right?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.290
<i>Poison?</i>

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:11.130
A beast person?

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.090
I will...

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.950
kill you.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.420
<i>I have to neutralize the poison, or else...</i>

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:30.320
I'm sorry. I can't let you kill me.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.700
<i>The poison didn't work?</i>

00:08:38.770 --> 00:08:39.910
<i>She's fast!</i>

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.550
Enchant Physical Ability!

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:54.380
<i>She hadn't already enhanced her 
physical abilities with magic?</i>

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.700
<i>But that movement...</i>

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:59.680
<i>How fast will she be after enhancing?</i>

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.310
<i>Why... Why is this person...</i>

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.410
<i>He's human. Why is he so fast?</i>

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.950
<i>She's too focused on the knife.</i>

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.480
This is as far as it goes. 
You understand me, right?

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.430
N-No... No!

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:56.990
I don't want to die!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.580
H-Hey! Calm down!

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.240
H-Help me! Mom!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.980
Mama!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.660
<i>I suppose I have no choice.</i>

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:21.050
<i>A Collar of Submission?</i>

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:28.560
<i>The magic in that book...</i>

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.330
<i>Dispell, was it?</i>

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.400
<i>If I imitate that, will this come off?</i>

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:54.310
Hey, Latifa! Wake up!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.140
Latifa...

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.030
Latifa?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.690
I'm Endo Suzune.

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:09.560
Are you still half-asleep?

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.350
Latifa...

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.030
What am I to you?

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.030
I am your esteemed older brother, Stewart.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.970
Come on, say, "my esteemed older brother"!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:33.000
I-I don't want—

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:40.170
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.680
"Esteemed older brother." Say it!

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:45.860
E-Esteemed older brother...

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:51.690
Hey. Wake up.

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.790
Stop that. Your hands and legs are bound.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.310
It seems you understand the situation.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:04.380
If you don't want to die, 
don't get violent like you did earlier.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:10.120
If I don't fight, then you won't kill me?

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.090
That depends on you.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:15.550
Did you come here from Beltrant?

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.250
Then...

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.470
Do you know what this is?

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.300
A... collar?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.340
It's... gone!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:27.470
Why?

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:31.600
This collar was the reason 
you were obeying orders, right?

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:34.300
You won't be stricken with pain any more.

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:53.620
Since the collar is gone, you won't have 
any problems answering my questions, right?

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.070
Who gave you your orders?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:02.630
You and I are the only 
ones here. Don't worry.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.750
I-I don't know my master's name.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:09.520
I've never been told, so...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.550
You don't even know the name of their house?

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:12.640
The name of the house?

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:18.430
B-But I do know the name of 
my esteemed older brother!

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:20.610
He said it was Stewart!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:24.630
Stewart... Is he a beast person, like you?

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:27.540
My older brother is human.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.870
The human who trained me.

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:31.130
Human...

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.870
<i>Then, it must be him.</i>

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.000
It's that commoner who's responsible!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.600
<i>Fearing that the truth may come to light,</i>

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.000
<i>Duke Huguenot decided to make me disappear.
 Thinking about it that way,</i>

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:44.830
<i>everything seems consistent, but...</i>

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.440
Are there others besides 
you trying to kill me?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.060
I don't know.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:56.760
But I don't think so... probably.

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:58.020
Then,

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.940
here is my final question.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:00.810
All right.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.030
Do you still intend to kill me?

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.110
I won't k-kill you!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.570
Do as you like, then.

00:14:13.050 --> 00:14:16.370
I've left all your equipment 
with that robe over there.

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:22.380
It means you're free to run away.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.710
Since the collar that controlled you is gone,

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.380
there's no need for you 
to go back to your master.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:34.390
<i>But here in Strahl, where 
beast people are made slaves,</i>

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.210
<i>there is nowhere safe for this girl.</i>

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.410
If you leave this kingdom 
and head to the east,

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.990
there is a vast area known as the Wilderness.

00:14:44.420 --> 00:14:45.950
Somewhere in that place,

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:50.640
there is a land where beast people like 
you and other demi-humans live together.

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:54.410
The Wilderness? East...

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:57.250
The direction I've been traveling.

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.200
Instead of staying here,

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.920
looking for others of your kind there 
might be an easier way for you to live.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:06.990
Others of my kind. East. Wilderness.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.590
I'll be going, then.

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:14.300
Let me tell you this. The next time 
you attack me, I won't show any mercy.

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:28.820
Did you still have some 
kind of business with me?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.490
U-Um, east...

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:34.570
I want to go with you.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:38.090
You seem to have misunderstood.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:42.810
I didn't release you from your enslavement 
because I wanted to rescue you.

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:48.090
It's only that not killing you was 
more convenient for me. That's all.

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:52.720
B-But... I don't know what I should do.

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:58.140
You know, I'm human, just like 
the people who enslaved you.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.720
Aren't you scared?

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.980
You don't feel... bad.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:08.970
You believe I would think nothing 
of you trying to kill me?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:16.110
I-I'm sorry.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.230
It's not like I'm angry.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:22.210
You couldn't disobey your 
orders is all, right?

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:27.380
But there's no guarantee that 
you won't attack me again.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.760
In short, I can't trust you.
 Do you understand?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:36.120
Then, th-this collar! You can put it on me!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:39.510
I don't mind! So please...

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:42.020
Wh-Why did you bring that?

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.890
You hated having that collar on, didn't you?

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:49.820
I hate being alone like this more.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.240
I'm scared.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:52.900
Please...

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:58.310
All right. Do what you want.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.370
Oh, uh, I will!

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.910
Thank you very much!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.940
Get rid of that collar.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:06.120
Oh!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:09.540
What's your name?

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.100
It's Latifa.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:13.300
I see.

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:14.780
I'm Rio.

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:17.050
Nice to meet you, Latifa.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.900
Yes, it is!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.520
I-I'm sorry.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.070
You don't need to apologize 
for something like that.

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:34.220
Here.

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:36.470
I'm allowed to eat that?

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:38.820
Yes. No need to be polite.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.220
It's delicious.

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:47.250
Yeah.

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.310
No one's going to steal it from you.
 Take your time eating.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:18:01.470
My meals... They said it was pet food... 
Every day, my older brother would...

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:10.730
We've just about reached the Wilderness.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.600
It's not too hard for you?

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:14.520
I'm fine.

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.140
We've already crossed the border, so...

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.370
It's a little early, but let's make camp here.

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:24.560
I'm sorry.

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.100
Why are you apologizing?

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.750
Because I'm holding you back.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.250
No, you're not.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:37.830
Haruto...

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.880
It's a letter from Rio!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.320
I'm so glad he seems well.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:45.710
Reaching Amande in three days...
That's so fast!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:48.470
Not receiving more news makes 
me feel a little lonely, but..

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.660
I hope that, wherever you are 
on your journey, you are safe.

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:00.610
Wow! Spaghetti?

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:02.730
You know what this is?

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:05.050
Yes! It's spaghetti!

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:07.000
May I eat some?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.410
S-Sure.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:10.370
Thank you for... the food!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.230
You've eaten pasta before?

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:19.140
Yes!

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:24.850
Oh, um... Yes, I used to eat it. I think.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.250
I see.

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:28.570
I thought you seemed accustomed to eating it.

00:19:28.970 --> 00:19:31.850
There's more. Eat as much as you want.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.820
Thank you!

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:38.140
<i>Calling this pasta "spaghetti" means...</i>

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.050
<i>Could it be that this girl is also...</i>

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.840
What's wrong?

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:51.120
I don't like this! Where am I?

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.630
I want to go home.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:20:00.430
It's all right. It's not scary anymore.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:04.290
Mom, Dad, Onii-san...

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:06.800
I want to go home to Tokyo...

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.320
Tokyo?!

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.370
<i>There really is no mistake. 
This girl is also...</i>

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.270
Onii-san...

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.440
Rest easy. Sleep.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.040
<i>His hair is black.</i>

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.980
<i>He does look like him, doesn't he?</i>

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.300
Onii-chan...

00:20:48.090 --> 00:20:51.070
Good morning. Did you sleep well?

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:54.600
Are you all right?

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.100
Yes, Onii...Rio!

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.050
Oni Rio?

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.820
N-No, that's not what I meant!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:06.200
I was about to say "Onii-chan," and then...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:11.000
Rio, would you mind if 
I called you O-Onii-chan?

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:11.710
What?

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:13.900
You d-don't want me to?

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:16.330
It's not that I mind, but...

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:20.470
Mom, Dad, Onii-san...

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.960
I want to go home to Tokyo...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:25.300
<i>A girl who was still so young</i>

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:29.580
<i>reincarnated from Earth to 
this world and was made a slave.</i>

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.650
<i>She must have felt so alone.</i>

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:35.470
<i>If this will comfort her 
heart even a little, then...</i>

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:55.580
Onii-chan!

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:57.900
What are we having for breakfast today?

00:21:57.900 --> 00:21:59.840
What do you want to eat, Latifa?

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:02.820
I want omelets! With cheese in them!

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:04.950
Omelets, huh? All right.

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:11.100
Say, Latifa?

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:14.730
You really can't see that big 
tree over there, can you?

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:18.650
The one you were talking about yesterday?
I can only see regular forest.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:22.010
<i>Latifa can't see it. That means...</i>

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:25.340
<i>Is it being blocked from people's 
awareness through magic?</i>

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:28.610
Onii-chan...

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.900
Are we really going in there?
We won't get lost?

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:33.150
We'll be fine.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:41.270
Onii-chan, it's very faint, 
but I smell something I don't recognize.

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:42.500
More than one scent.

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.710
Is it different from an animal's scent?

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:45.730
Yes.

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:51.280
Since it's faint, whatever the scent 
belongs to isn't nearby, right?

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:54.140
Yes, I think.

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:56.890
In that case, why don't we 
rest around here for today?

00:22:57.260 --> 00:22:59.640
Our goal may be close by.

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:01.180
Really?

00:23:01.180 --> 00:23:03.580
We'll finally be able to leave the forest!

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:13.410
Is she having another nightmare?

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:20.270
<i>With this, she won't have any scary dreams.</i>

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:32.700
What?!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:39.890
Next Time

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:39.890
Forest of Spirits

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:37.860
"Forest of Spirits."

